<title>USA: Columbia Cty, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Columbia Cty, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc. said it won $6.544 million of Columbia Cty, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.5213 percent.</p>
</text>
